1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,413
Bugungi videomiz… «Siz qanday odamsiz?» mavzusida — «Insonning xususiyatlarini tasvirlash».

2
00:00:10,413 --> 00:00:23,015
Videoning biror joyida yapon tilida savol beriladi. Agar eshitgan boʻlsangiz, izoh qoldiring. 1-Sahna: Yangi oʻqituvchining xususiyatlari / New Teacher’s Characteristics

3
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:27,894
Yangi yapon tili oʻqituvchisi qanday odam?

4
00:00:27,917 --> 00:00:31,450
Juda baland boʻyli oʻqituvchi.

5
00:00:31,473 --> 00:00:33,520
Sochlari uzunmi?

6
00:00:33,543 --> 00:00:37,239
Yoʻq, sochlari qisqa.

7
00:00:37,263 --> 00:00:41,196
U erkak oʻqituvchimı, ayol oʻqituvchimı?

8
00:00:41,219 --> 00:00:43,752
Erkak oʻqituvchi.

9
00:00:43,775 --> 00:00:46,109
Yosh oʻqituvchimı?

10
00:00:46,132 --> 00:00:49,665
Ha, juda yosh koʻrinadi.

11
00:00:49,688 --> 00:00:52,156
Koʻzoynak taqib yuradimi?

12
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:55,793
Ha, qora koʻzoynak taqib yuradi.

13
00:00:55,816 --> 00:00:58,249
Koʻzlari kattami?

14
00:00:58,272 --> 00:01:02,047
Koʻzlari uncha katta emas.

15
00:01:02,071 --> 00:01:04,804
Doimo qanday kiyim kiyadi?

16
00:01:04,827 --> 00:01:08,594
Doimo koʻk rangli koʻylak kiyadi.

17
00:01:08,617 --> 00:01:10,817
Chiroyli oʻqituvchimı?

18
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:14,530
Ha, juda chiroyli.

19
00:01:14,554 --> 00:01:16,921
Mehribon oʻqituvchimı?

20
00:01:16,944 --> 00:01:20,618
Doimo tabassum bilan, mehribon koʻrinadi.

21
00:01:20,641 --> 00:01:22,975
Tana tuzilishi katta?

22
00:01:22,998 --> 00:01:27,094
Baland boʻyli, ozgina ozgʻin.

23
00:01:27,117 --> 00:01:29,450
Ovozi balandmi?

24
00:01:29,473 --> 00:01:33,450
Ha, juda baland ovozda gapiradi.

25
00:01:33,474 --> 00:01:36,076
Tushunarli ekan.

26
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:40,267
Oʻqituvchining soati juda katta.

27
00:01:40,290 --> 00:01:42,168
Qanday soat?

28
00:01:42,191 --> 00:01:45,630
Qizil va dumaloq soat.

29
00:01:45,653 --> 00:01:47,656
Qiziqarli ekan.

30
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:51,446
Ertaga sinfda tanishtirib qoʻyaman.

31
00:01:51,469 --> 00:01:54,324
Ha, shoshlanaman.

32
00:01:54,348 --> 00:01:58,282
A, ana u yangi oʻqituvchi.

33
00:01:58,304 --> 00:02:02,104
Vaa, haqiqatan ham baland boʻyli ekan.

34
00:02:02,127 --> 00:02:05,604
Qarang, koʻk koʻylak kiygan.

35
00:02:05,628 --> 00:02:08,095
Darrov tanidim.

36
00:02:08,118 --> 00:02:15,223
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori izohda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

37
00:02:15,223 --> 00:02:18,223
2-Sahna: Inson xususiyatlarini tasvirlash / Describing a Person’s Features

38
00:02:18,223 --> 00:02:22,122
Tanaka-san qayerda?

39
00:02:22,146 --> 00:02:26,579
Hozir stansiya oldida turibdi.

40
00:02:26,602 --> 00:02:31,602
Stansiya oldida odamlar koʻp ekan.

41
00:02:31,625 --> 00:02:36,694
Tanaka-san qanday kiyim kiygan?

42
00:02:36,717 --> 00:02:40,287
Oq jaket kiygan.

43
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:43,912
Shimining rangi qanaqa?

44
00:02:43,936 --> 00:02:47,469
Qora shim kiygan.

45
00:02:47,492 --> 00:02:50,531
Shlyapa kiyganmi?

46
00:02:50,555 --> 00:02:55,452
Ha, jigarrang shlyapa kiygan.

47
00:02:55,475 --> 00:02:58,642
Sochlari uzunmi, qisqami?

48
00:02:58,665 --> 00:03:00,701
Qisqami?

49
00:03:00,725 --> 00:03:04,758
Sochlari biroz uzun.

50
00:03:04,781 --> 00:03:07,655
Sumka olganmi?

51
00:03:07,679 --> 00:03:12,372
Katta sariq sumka tutyapman.

52
00:03:12,395 --> 00:03:16,329
Sariq sumka koʻzga tashlanadiku!

53
00:03:16,352 --> 00:03:20,552
Tanaka-san baland boʻylimi?

54
00:03:20,575 --> 00:03:24,650
Yoʻq, uncha baland emas.

55
00:03:24,673 --> 00:03:28,330
Koʻzoynak taqmaganmi?

56
00:03:28,354 --> 00:03:31,120
Koʻzoynak taqmagan.

57
00:03:31,143 --> 00:03:35,777
U yerda jigarrang shlyapa kiygan odam bor.

58
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:39,875
U odam oq kurtkami?

59
00:03:39,898 --> 00:03:44,232
Ha, oq kurtka kiygan.

60
00:03:44,255 --> 00:03:47,539
Sariq sumka tutyaptimi?

61
00:03:47,562 --> 00:03:52,005
A, kichik qora sumka tutyapti.

62
00:03:52,028 --> 00:03:56,716
Demak, u Tanaka-san emas ekan.

63
00:03:56,740 --> 00:04:01,012
Tanaka-sanning poyabzali qanday rang?

64
00:04:01,036 --> 00:04:04,677
Qizil krossovka kiygan.

65
00:04:04,701 --> 00:04:09,472
A, u tomonda qizil krossovka kiygan odam turibdi.

66
00:04:09,495 --> 00:04:12,551
Shlyapa kiyganmi?

67
00:04:12,575 --> 00:04:15,941
Ha, jigarrang shlyapa.

68
00:04:15,964 --> 00:04:18,580
Sumkasi sariqmi?

69
00:04:18,604 --> 00:04:22,900
Ha, katta sariq sumka.

70
00:04:22,923 --> 00:04:26,257
Ana u Tanaka-san ekan.

71
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:35,359
Tushunsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

72
00:04:35,359 --> 00:04:38,359
3-Sahna: Oila suratlarini tanishtirish

73
00:04:38,359 --> 00:04:41,959
Bu oila suratimi?

74
00:04:41,982 --> 00:04:43,182
Ha.

75
00:04:43,205 --> 00:04:46,459
Bu oʻtgan yozda olingan surat.

76
00:04:46,482 --> 00:04:51,732
Bu baland boʻyli erkak kishi akangizmi?

77
00:04:51,756 --> 00:04:56,156
Yoʻq, bu mening ukam.

78
00:04:56,179 --> 00:05:00,379
Ukam juda baland boʻyli ekan-ku!

79
00:05:00,402 --> 00:05:02,002
Ha.

80
00:05:02,025 --> 00:05:05,203
Boʻyi 180 santimetr.

81
00:05:05,226 --> 00:05:09,959
Sochi kalta, sportda zoʻr koʻrinadi.

82
00:05:09,982 --> 00:05:11,198
Ha.

83
00:05:11,222 --> 00:05:14,280
Har kuni futbol oʻynaydi.

84
00:05:14,304 --> 00:05:19,637
Bu chiroyli ayol opangizmi?

85
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:21,027
Ha.

86
00:05:21,050 --> 00:05:23,653
Mening opam.

87
00:05:23,676 --> 00:05:28,882
Sochi uzun, koʻzi katta, juda yoqimtoy!

88
00:05:28,906 --> 00:05:32,202
Opa onamga juda oʻxshaydi.

89
00:05:32,226 --> 00:05:34,921
Onangiz qaysi biri?

90
00:05:34,945 --> 00:05:37,878
Opaning yonida turgan odam.

91
00:05:37,901 --> 00:05:40,999
Onangiz ham sochi uzunmi?

92
00:05:41,022 --> 00:05:45,224
Yoʻq, onamning sochi kalta.

93
00:05:45,247 --> 00:05:47,664
Kimono kiyibdi-ku!

94
00:05:47,688 --> 00:05:49,055
Ha.

95
00:05:49,078 --> 00:05:51,354
Yangi yil kuni kiygan edi.

96
00:05:51,377 --> 00:05:54,744
Otangiz qayerda?

97
00:05:54,767 --> 00:05:58,700
Orqada koʻzoynak taqqan odam.

98
00:05:58,723 --> 00:06:03,090
Otangiz mehribon koʻrinadi-ku!

99
00:06:03,113 --> 00:06:04,579
Ha.

100
00:06:04,602 --> 00:06:07,697
Juda jiddiy va mehribon.

101
00:06:07,721 --> 00:06:10,688
Otangiz semizmi?

102
00:06:10,711 --> 00:06:14,311
Yoʻq, ozgina ozgʻin.

103
00:06:14,334 --> 00:06:18,367
Siz otangizga oʻxshaysiz-ku!

104
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,390
Koʻp aytishadi.

105
00:06:20,413 --> 00:06:24,213
Ayniqsa, burun shakli juda oʻxshash.

106
00:06:24,236 --> 00:06:28,106
Shundaymi? Bir oz uyalaman.

107
00:06:28,130 --> 00:06:32,130
Qizgʻin va baxtli oilangiz bor ekan, koʻrinib turibdi!

108
00:06:32,153 --> 00:06:33,519
Ha.

109
00:06:33,542 --> 00:06:36,281
Hammangiz koʻp gapirasizlar.

110
00:06:36,305 --> 00:06:38,592
Chiroyli rasm ekan!

111
00:06:38,615 --> 00:06:40,906
Rahmat.

112
00:06:40,930 --> 00:06:43,930
4-Sahna: Yon stolagi odamning tavsifi / Yon stoladagi odamni tasvirlash

113
00:06:43,930 --> 00:06:47,930
Yon stolga qarang.

114
00:06:47,953 --> 00:06:49,807
Qaysi odam?

115
00:06:49,831 --> 00:06:54,317
Ana, yolgʻiz kitob oʻqiayotgan odam.

116
00:06:54,341 --> 00:06:59,151
Oq sochli, kalta sochli cholmi?

117
00:06:59,174 --> 00:07:04,174
Yoʻq, uning yonidagi yosh ayol.

118
00:07:04,197 --> 00:07:08,079
A, ana oʻsha goʻzal ayol.

119
00:07:08,103 --> 00:07:12,036
Sochlari uzun va tekis ekan.

120
00:07:12,059 --> 00:07:16,126
Koʻzlari biroz koʻkdek koʻrinadi.

121
00:07:16,150 --> 00:07:18,559
Chet ellikmi?

122
00:07:18,582 --> 00:07:22,116
Bilmayman.

123
00:07:22,139 --> 00:07:25,105
Oq koʻylak kiyibdi, juda chiroyli.

124
00:07:25,128 --> 00:07:29,062
Juda mos tushibdi, goʻzal.

125
00:07:29,085 --> 00:07:31,418
Boʻyi balandmi?

126
00:07:31,441 --> 00:07:33,095
Pastmi?

127
00:07:33,118 --> 00:07:38,094
Oturibdi, shuning uchun bilmayman, lekin balanddek koʻrinadi.

128
00:07:38,118 --> 00:07:41,485
Qoʻllari juda nozik va chiroyli.

129
00:07:41,509 --> 00:07:44,594
Barmoqlari uzun ekan.

130
00:07:44,617 --> 00:07:47,354
Nima ichyapti?

131
00:07:47,377 --> 00:07:50,623
Issiq choy ichyapti.

132
00:07:50,647 --> 00:07:53,516
Sumkasi qanday?

133
00:07:53,540 --> 00:07:58,173
Stol ostida qora charm sumka bor.

134
00:07:58,196 --> 00:08:01,470
U soat taqibdimi?

135
00:08:01,493 --> 00:08:06,227
Ha, kichik kumush rangli soat taqibdi.

136
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:09,744
Juda jim kitob oʻqiyapti.

137
00:08:09,767 --> 00:08:13,134
Qanday kitob oʻqiyapti, bilasizmi?

138
00:08:13,157 --> 00:08:16,845
Qiyin iyeroglifli kitobdek koʻrinadi.

139
00:08:16,868 --> 00:08:19,735
Aqlli odamdek koʻrinadi.

140
00:08:19,758 --> 00:08:23,524
Vay, hozir soatiga qaradi.

141
00:08:23,547 --> 00:08:26,992
Kimnidir kutayotgan boʻlishi mumkin.

142
00:08:27,016 --> 00:08:30,291
Tabassumi juda yoqimli.

143
00:08:30,315 --> 00:08:33,971
Haqiqatan ham jozibali odam ekan.

144
00:08:33,995 --> 00:08:36,995
5-Sahna: Yamada-sanning tavsifi / Yamada haqida

145
00:08:36,995 --> 00:08:41,974
Yangi xodim Yamada-sanni taniysizmi?

146
00:08:41,997 --> 00:08:44,531
Hali uchrashmaganman.

147
00:08:44,554 --> 00:08:46,487
Qanday odam?

148
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:51,477
Juda quvnoq va yorqin tabiatli erkak.

149
00:08:51,499 --> 00:08:54,366
Boʻyi balandmi?

150
00:08:54,389 --> 00:08:58,522
Yoʻq, uncha baland emas.

151
00:08:58,545 --> 00:09:01,512
Tana tuzilishi kattami?

152
00:09:01,535 --> 00:09:06,668
Biroz semiz, lekin mushaklari bor.

153
00:09:06,691 --> 00:09:09,691
Soch turmagi qanday?

154
00:09:09,714 --> 00:09:14,563
Sochlari kalta va qora.

155
00:09:14,587 --> 00:09:17,638
Koʻzoynak taqadimi?

156
00:09:17,661 --> 00:09:22,400
Ha, dumaloq koʻzoynak taqadi.

157
00:09:22,424 --> 00:09:25,958
Yuzida oʻziga xos xususiyatlari bormi?

158
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:29,870
Qoshlari juda qalin.

159
00:09:29,894 --> 00:09:33,028
Qoshlaringiz qalin ekan.

160
00:09:33,051 --> 00:09:35,852
Eslab qolish oson.

161
00:09:35,875 --> 00:09:40,494
Shuningdek, quloqlaringiz ham biroz katta.

162
00:09:40,517 --> 00:09:43,331
Ovozi qanday?

163
00:09:43,355 --> 00:09:48,688
Past va juda yoqimli ovoz.

164
00:09:48,711 --> 00:09:52,346
Odatda qanday kostyum kiyib yursangiz boʻladi?

165
00:09:52,370 --> 00:09:56,503
Koʻpincha kulrang kostyum kiyaman.

166
00:09:56,526 --> 00:09:59,462
Galstuk rangi qanday?

167
00:09:59,485 --> 00:10:03,685
Bugun qizil galstuk taqdiman.

168
00:10:03,708 --> 00:10:06,375
Oyoq kiyimlaringiz toza-mi?

169
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:11,244
Ha, qora charm tuflilarim har doim porloq.

170
00:10:11,267 --> 00:10:14,201
Jiddiy odamdek koʻrinasiz.

171
00:10:14,225 --> 00:10:19,258
Ha, ishni tez bajaradigan odamdek.

172
00:10:19,281 --> 00:10:21,931
Yoshiz necha yoshda?

173
00:10:21,954 --> 00:10:25,188
30 yoshda deb oʻylayman.

174
00:10:25,211 --> 00:10:28,705
Yosh va ishonchli koʻrinasiz.

175
00:10:28,729 --> 00:10:32,895
A, u yerda nusxa koʻchirayotgan odam.

176
00:10:32,918 --> 00:10:36,328
U, dumaloq koʻzoynak taqqan odammi?

177
00:10:36,352 --> 00:10:40,352
Ha, u Yamada-san.

178
00:10:40,375 --> 00:10:44,231
Keyinroq salom berib kelaman.

179
00:10:44,254 --> 00:10:47,254
Sahna 6: Yoʻqolgan bolaning xususiyatlarini aniqlash

180
00:10:47,254 --> 00:10:48,864
Kechirasiz.

181
00:10:48,887 --> 00:10:51,521
Yoʻqolgan bolani qidiryapman.

182
00:10:51,543 --> 00:10:54,013
Bolangiz qanday?

183
00:10:54,037 --> 00:10:57,439
5 yoshli oʻgʻil bola.

184
00:10:57,463 --> 00:11:00,111
Ismi nima?

185
00:11:00,134 --> 00:11:02,409
Takeshi-kun.

186
00:11:02,433 --> 00:11:06,501
Takeshi-kunning boʻyi qanchaga teng?

187
00:11:06,524 --> 00:11:10,258
100 santimetr atrofida.

188
00:11:10,281 --> 00:11:13,579
Sochlari qanday?

189
00:11:13,602 --> 00:11:18,891
Sochlari qisqa va jigarrangroq.

190
00:11:18,914 --> 00:11:21,881
Koʻzlari katta-mi?

191
00:11:21,904 --> 00:11:26,737
Ha, koʻzlari yumaloq va katta.

192
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:30,843
Bugun qanday kiyim kiygan edi?

193
00:11:30,867 --> 00:11:34,334
Sariq futbolka kiygan edi.

194
00:11:34,357 --> 00:11:38,629
Futbolkada rasmlar bormi?

195
00:11:38,653 --> 00:11:43,187
Old tomonida katta maxluq rasmi bor.

196
00:11:43,210 --> 00:11:46,386
Shimlari qanday rangda?

197
00:11:46,409 --> 00:11:50,142
Koʻk yarim shim kiygan.

198
00:11:50,165 --> 00:11:53,498
Oyoq kiyimlari qanday?

199
00:11:53,521 --> 00:11:56,993
Oq sport poyabzali.

200
00:11:57,017 --> 00:12:01,450
Shlyapa kiyganmi edi?

201
00:12:01,473 --> 00:12:05,754
Ha, yashil shlyapa kiygan edi.

202
00:12:05,778 --> 00:12:08,544
Sumkasi bormi?

203
00:12:08,567 --> 00:12:12,601
Kichik qizil ryukzak ortgan.

204
00:12:12,624 --> 00:12:16,319
Boshqa oʻziga xos xususiyatlari bormi?

205
00:12:16,342 --> 00:12:20,876
Oʻng tomonida kichik xol bor.

206
00:12:20,899 --> 00:12:22,932
Tushunarli.

207
00:12:22,955 --> 00:12:25,014
Qidirib koʻramiz.

208
00:12:25,038 --> 00:12:27,411
Juda xavotirdaman.

209
00:12:27,434 --> 00:12:29,567
Iltimos, yordam bering.

210
00:12:29,590 --> 00:12:32,190
Yigʻlayotgan edingizmi?

211
00:12:32,213 --> 00:12:34,251
Kulayotgan edingizmi?

212
00:12:34,275 --> 00:12:37,008
Juda sergak holda yugurayotgan edi.

213
00:12:37,031 --> 00:12:39,669
Tez orada topilishi mumkin.

214
00:12:39,692 --> 00:12:41,492
Xavotir olmang.

215
00:12:41,515 --> 00:12:46,809
A, u yerda sariq futbolka koʻrinib turibdi.

216
00:12:46,833 --> 00:12:50,100
Qizil ryukzak ortidami?

217
00:12:50,123 --> 00:12:53,527
Ha, ortida.

218
00:12:53,551 --> 00:12:55,084
Bu Takeshi.

219
00:12:55,107 --> 00:12:57,274
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku!

220
00:12:57,297 --> 00:12:59,535
Ehtiyot boʻling.

221
00:12:59,558 --> 00:13:02,558
7-Sahna: Sevimli xonandamning xususiyatlari

222
00:13:02,558 --> 00:13:07,725
Sizning eng sevimli xonandangiz kim?

223
00:13:07,748 --> 00:13:13,314
Men Yaponiyalik Renni eng yaxshi koʻraman.

224
00:13:13,337 --> 00:13:16,539
Ren qanday odam?

225
00:13:16,563 --> 00:13:20,896
Juda yaxshi qomatli erkak.

226
00:13:20,919 --> 00:13:23,213
Boʻyi balandmi?

227
00:13:23,237 --> 00:13:28,890
Ha, boʻyi juda baland va oyogʻi uzun.

228
00:13:28,914 --> 00:13:31,914
Yuzi qanday?

229
00:13:31,937 --> 00:13:36,937
Yuzining shakli juda mayda va burni baland.

230
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:41,127
Soch turmagi har doim bir xilmi?

231
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:46,920
Yoʻq, tez-tez oʻzgaradi, lekin hozir uzun.

232
00:13:46,944 --> 00:13:49,983
Soch rangi qanday?

233
00:13:50,006 --> 00:13:54,539
Hozir chiroyli kumush rangda.

234
00:13:54,562 --> 00:13:58,135
Kumush rangli soch kamdan-kam uchraydi-ku.

235
00:13:58,159 --> 00:14:02,792
Ha, sahnada juda porlaydi.

236
00:14:02,815 --> 00:14:05,790
Koʻzi qanday?

237
00:14:05,814 --> 00:14:10,684
Koʻzi ingichka va sovuqroq koʻrinishga ega.

238
00:14:10,707 --> 00:14:14,483
Tana tuzilishi ozgʻinmi?

239
00:14:14,507 --> 00:14:18,873
Ha, juda ozgʻin, lekin kuchli.

240
00:14:18,896 --> 00:14:22,030
Qanday kiyimlarni koʻproq kiyadi?

241
00:14:22,053 --> 00:14:25,942
Koʻpincha qora uzun palto kiyadi.

242
00:14:25,965 --> 00:14:28,365
Juda ham zoʻr koʻrinadi-ku!

243
00:14:28,388 --> 00:14:31,265
Sirgʻa taqadimi?

244
00:14:31,288 --> 00:14:36,138
Ha, chap qulogʻiga uchta taqadi.

245
00:14:36,162 --> 00:14:38,397
Qoʻli katta-mi?

246
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:43,220
Qoʻli katta va barmoqlari juda ingichka.

247
00:14:43,243 --> 00:14:45,976
Ovozi qanday?

248
00:14:45,999 --> 00:14:50,566
Ovozi shirin va bir oz past.

249
00:14:50,589 --> 00:14:52,805
Eshitib koʻrishni xohlardim.

250
00:14:52,828 --> 00:14:56,461
Navbatda CD ni ijaraga beraman.

251
00:14:56,484 --> 00:14:58,166
Rahmat.

252
00:14:58,190 --> 00:15:00,123
Kutgandayman!

253
00:15:00,146 --> 00:15:03,146
8-Sahna: Suzuki-saning sevgilisi haqida

254
00:15:03,146 --> 00:15:08,479
Kecha Suzuki-saning yangi sevgilisiga uchradim.

255
00:15:08,502 --> 00:15:10,912
Rostdanmi?

256
00:15:10,936 --> 00:15:13,369
Qanday odam edi?

257
00:15:13,392 --> 00:15:17,592
Juda mehribon koʻrinishli erkak edi.

258
00:15:17,615 --> 00:15:20,182
Boʻyi balandmi?

259
00:15:20,205 --> 00:15:21,772
Pastmi?

260
00:15:21,796 --> 00:15:25,429
Suzuki-sandan bir oz balandroq.

261
00:15:25,452 --> 00:15:28,269
Soch turmagi qanday?

262
00:15:28,292 --> 00:15:32,626
Qisqa sochli va juda pokiza koʻrinishga ega.

263
00:15:32,649 --> 00:15:35,491
Koʻzoynak taqib yurgan edingizmi?

264
00:15:35,515 --> 00:15:38,681
Yoʻq, taqmagan edim.

265
00:15:38,704 --> 00:15:41,238
Semizroqmisiz?

266
00:15:41,261 --> 00:15:43,297
Ozgʻinmisiz?

267
00:15:43,321 --> 00:15:47,721
Oddiy tanaga egaman, lekin yelkam keng.

268
00:15:47,744 --> 00:15:50,877
Qandaydir sport bilan shugʻullanasizmi?

269
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:54,714
Avval suzish bilan shugʻullangan ekan.

270
00:15:54,737 --> 00:15:57,871
Shuning uchun yelkangiz keng ekan.

271
00:15:57,894 --> 00:16:01,373
Yuzingizda qanday oʻziga xos xususiyatlar bor?

272
00:16:01,396 --> 00:16:04,996
Koʻzi mehribon va osilib turadi.

273
00:16:05,019 --> 00:16:08,219
Osilib turgan koʻzli odamlar mehribon koʻrinadi, shunday emasmi?

274
00:16:08,242 --> 00:16:12,275
Ha, doimo tabassum qilib turardi.

275
00:16:12,298 --> 00:16:15,197
Kiyimi qanday edi?

276
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:18,754
Koʻk rangli chiziqli koʻylak kiygan edi.

277
00:16:18,777 --> 00:16:21,043
Shimlari jinsi shimmi?

278
00:16:21,066 --> 00:16:25,066
Ha, chiroyli jinsi shim kiygan edi.

279
00:16:25,089 --> 00:16:27,656
Soat taqib yurgan edingizmi?

280
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:31,012
Qora sport soati taqib yurgan edi.

281
00:16:31,035 --> 00:16:33,721
Yoshroq koʻrindingizmi?

282
00:16:33,744 --> 00:16:37,111
Suzuki bilan deyarli bir xil yoshda koʻrindi.

283
00:16:37,134 --> 00:16:39,612
Juda mos keladigan juftlik ekansiz.

284
00:16:39,636 --> 00:16:43,515
Ha, juda baxtli koʻrinardi.

285
00:16:43,538 --> 00:16:46,831
Men ham tezroq uchrashishni istayman.

286
00:16:46,855 --> 00:16:50,455
Navbatda hammamiz birga ovqatlanamiz.

287
00:16:50,478 --> 00:16:53,478
9-sahna: Xususiyatlari boʻyicha odamni topish

288
00:16:53,478 --> 00:16:58,127
Ziyofatda juda koʻp odam bor ekan.

289
00:16:58,150 --> 00:17:01,585
Sato-san qayerda turibdi?

290
00:17:01,608 --> 00:17:04,847
Sato-sanning xususiyatlarini aytib bering.

291
00:17:04,870 --> 00:17:10,437
Sato-san sochlari kalta va yuzi biroz yumaloq.

292
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:12,693
Boʻyi balandmi?

293
00:17:12,716 --> 00:17:16,396
Yoʻq, boʻyi uncha baland emas.

294
00:17:16,420 --> 00:17:19,453
Bugun qanday kiyim kiygan?

295
00:17:19,476 --> 00:17:22,709
Qizil koʻylak kiygan ekan.

296
00:17:22,732 --> 00:17:26,666
Qizil koʻylak kiygan uch kishi bor ekan.

297
00:17:26,689 --> 00:17:29,866
Zargarlik buyumlari taqib yurganmisiz?

298
00:17:29,890 --> 00:17:34,056
Marvarid marjon taqib yurganini aytgan edi.

299
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:37,012
Ana, oʻrtada turgan odammi?

300
00:17:37,035 --> 00:17:40,525
U odamning sochlari uzun ekan.

301
00:17:40,549 --> 00:17:43,045
Ha, rostdan ham.

302
00:17:43,068 --> 00:17:45,635
Sochlari kalta emas.

303
00:17:45,658 --> 00:17:48,791
Oʻng tomonda turgan odam qanday?

304
00:17:48,814 --> 00:17:52,581
U odam qora koʻzoynak taqib yuribdi.

305
00:17:52,604 --> 00:17:55,770
Sato-san koʻzoynak taqadimi?

306
00:17:55,793 --> 00:17:59,527
Yoʻq, Sato-san koʻzoynak taqmaydi.

307
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:03,188
Demak, chap tomonda turgan odam.

308
00:18:03,211 --> 00:18:06,744
Sochlari kalta va yuzi yumaloqmi?

309
00:18:06,767 --> 00:18:10,849
Ha, juda yoqimli yumaloq yuz.

310
00:18:10,873 --> 00:18:13,276
Marjonlari marvaridmi?

311
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:17,139
Ha, oq marvarid marjon.

312
00:18:17,162 --> 00:18:20,041
Qizil koʻylak ham kiygan ekan.

313
00:18:20,064 --> 00:18:23,598
Ha, chiroyli qizil koʻylak.

314
00:18:23,621 --> 00:18:26,716
Oyoq kiyimingiz qaysi rangda?

315
00:18:26,739 --> 00:18:29,939
Qora baland poshnali tuflimni kiyganman.

316
00:18:29,962 --> 00:18:32,047
Xato yoʻq.

317
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:34,504
Ana u Sato-san.

318
00:18:34,528 --> 00:18:37,016
Nihoyat topdik-ku!

319
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:40,007
Birga salom berishga boring.

320
00:18:40,030 --> 00:18:43,030
Sahna 10: Shibuya shahrida kelishgan yigitni topish

321
00:18:43,030 --> 00:18:48,286
Kecha Shibuyada juda kelishgan bir kishini koʻrdim.

322
00:18:48,309 --> 00:18:50,351
Erkakmi?

323
00:18:50,374 --> 00:18:52,508
Ayolmi?

324
00:18:52,531 --> 00:18:56,107
Baland boʻyli erkak edi.

325
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:59,304
Boʻyi qanchalik baland edi?

326
00:18:59,328 --> 00:19:03,863
Taxminan 185 santimetr bordek edi.

327
00:19:03,887 --> 00:19:06,687
Modeldek koʻrinardi.

328
00:19:06,710 --> 00:19:11,076
Ha, gavdasi juda yaxshi edi.

329
00:19:11,099 --> 00:19:14,133
Sochi qaysi rangda edi?

330
00:19:14,156 --> 00:19:18,389
Och jigarrang soch, perm qilingan edi.

331
00:19:18,412 --> 00:19:21,345
Juda zamonaviy soch turmasi.

332
00:19:21,368 --> 00:19:24,413
Yuzi qanday edi?

333
00:19:24,437 --> 00:19:29,124
Koʻzi oʻtkir va katta edi.

334
00:19:29,147 --> 00:19:31,845
Terisi oqmi edi?

335
00:19:31,869 --> 00:19:36,487
Yoʻq, biroz bugʻdoy rangda edi.

336
00:19:36,511 --> 00:19:39,345
Sogʻlom koʻrinardi.

337
00:19:39,368 --> 00:19:42,802
Qanday kiyim kiygan edi?

338
00:19:42,825 --> 00:19:47,158
Keng qora futbolka kiygan edi.

339
00:19:47,181 --> 00:19:50,052
Shimlari qanday edi?

340
00:19:50,075 --> 00:19:54,043
Oq, keng shim kiygan edi.

341
00:19:54,067 --> 00:19:58,067
Boʻyinbogʻ yoki uzuk taqganmi edi?

342
00:19:58,090 --> 00:20:01,574
Kumush rangli uzun boʻyinbogʻ taqgan edi.

343
00:20:01,597 --> 00:20:04,431
Sumka olganmi edi?

344
00:20:04,454 --> 00:20:08,092
Kichik qora yelkama sumkasi bor edi.

345
00:20:08,115 --> 00:20:10,948
Necha yoshda koʻrindi?

346
00:20:10,971 --> 00:20:15,971
Taxminan 22-23 yoshda koʻrindi.

347
00:20:15,994 --> 00:20:19,594
Mashhur boʻlishi mumkin.

348
00:20:19,617 --> 00:20:23,852
Rostdan ham, atrofidagilar hammasi qarab turishdi.

349
00:20:23,876 --> 00:20:26,689
Yana uchrashsak yaxshi boʻlardi.

350
00:20:26,712 --> 00:20:29,968
Bugun ham Shibuyaga borib koʻrayapman.